{
  "_about": "Marker data for the bundled maps. Layer points are fractions (0-1) of the bundled map IMAGE. cellar/gate/car were extracted from the rings drawn on the images themselves (Hough circle detection); gas was traced from the gas-spawn maps by u/deftyconchgaming (see gas-spawns.json). tab maps an image fraction onto the in-game Tab map panel, as a fraction of the panel interior square (x 877..1662, y 147..932 on a 1919x1078 frame - the square matcher.js documents): u = ax*x + bx, v = ay*y + by. Registered by boundary-silhouette overlap against detection-fixtures/tab-fullscreen-civilian-*.png (IoU 0.96-0.98) and checked against real discovered exits in maps-src/tab-reference (3-5 px on a 762 px panel). All are POSSIBLE locations: the game activates a varying subset per match.",
